            "description": "<p>We use your personal information – such as your address and transaction details – to fulfill, validate, manage, deliver, and/or track your orders and transactions; process payments; process and verify returns and refunds; provide and improve our customer service; and to facilitate curbside pick-up and delivery services.</p>"
