            "heading": "To provide you personalized advertising, marketing, advocacy options, and other information we think may be of interest to you.",
            "description": "<p>For example, we use your personal information – such as your IP address and device identifiers – to help us or our service providers deliver interest-based advertising and content that is tailored to your individual interests. This includes advertising networks and our data analytics service providers who facilitate customized advertising and marketing services.</p>"
